是我闻： 一时，佛在王舍城耆阇崛山中，与大比丘众及菩萨众俱。时佛世尊即入三昧，名广大甚深。 尔时众中有菩萨摩诃萨，名观自在，行深般若波罗蜜</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%8e%9f%e7%89%88%20%e5%bf%83%e7%bb%8f.assets/640.webp" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>心经</category><category>修行分享</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item><item><title>孝亲报恩日·佛欢喜日</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%AD%9D%E4%BA%B2%E6%8A%A5%E6%81%A9%E6%97%A5-%E4%BD%9B%E6%AC%A2%E5%96%9C%E6%97%A5/</link><pubDate>Sun, 11 Aug 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sun, 11 Aug 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%AD%9D%E4%BA%B2%E6%8A%A5%E6%81%A9%E6%97%A5-%E4%BD%9B%E6%AC%A2%E5%96%9C%E6%97%A5/</guid><description>中元节，一个承载着深厚文化底蕴与浓厚情感色彩的传统节日，在中国民俗文化中占据着举足轻重的地位。中元节不仅融合了道教、佛教的信仰元素，还深刻体</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%ad%9d%e4%ba%b2%e6%8a%a5%e6%81%a9%e6%97%a5%20%e4%bd%9b%e6%ac%a2%e5%96%9c%e6%97%a5.assets/640.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修心</category><category>修行分享</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item><item><title>夏日小记 | 一场际遇</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%A4%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%B0%8F%E8%AE%B0-%E4%B8%80%E5%9C%BA%E9%99%85%E9%81%87/</link><pubDate>Sat, 20 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sat, 20 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%A4%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%B0%8F%E8%AE%B0-%E4%B8%80%E5%9C%BA%E9%99%85%E9%81%87/</guid><description>01 一切都过去了 大家都知道杨医生爱喝茶。多伦多的道友也都知道，杨医生每次泡茶用的水都是开车去郊外打的山泉水&amp;hellip;今日有幸和杨医生一起</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%a4%8f%e6%97%a5%e5%b0%8f%e8%ae%b0%20%e4%b8%80%e5%9c%ba%e9%99%85%e9%81%87.assets/640-1721835588333-49.webp" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>茶桌闲谈</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item><item><title>如是当下</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%A6%82%E6%98%AF%E5%BD%93%E4%B8%8B/</link><pubDate>Wed, 13 Mar 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 13 Mar 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%A6%82%E6%98%AF%E5%BD%93%E4%B8%8B/</guid><description>国外呆了很多年，我这个人特别懒得动。2019年也不知道哪根筋搭错了，屁颠屁颠地跑回中国，而且这一跑不得了。 从上海到成都然后藏地，又浙江 - 衢州</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%a6%82%e6%98%af%e5%bd%93%e4%b8%8b.assets/image-20240317112410137.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>茶桌闲谈</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item></channel></rss>